    "Elle surestime souvent les personnes minces et sous-estime les personnes à forte masse grasse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It tends to overestimate lean people and underestimate people with more body fat."
