    "La projection calcule une perte de poids ; ton objectif est déjà atteint ou au-dessus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The projection works out a weight loss; your goal is already reached or above your current weight."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le tour de taille doit dépasser le tour de cou.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your waist must be larger than your neck."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les charges sont arrondies à ton matériel (« %@ »). Aucune étude ne fixe un schéma unique : c’est une progression courante, à ajuster comme tu veux.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loads are rounded to your equipment (“%@”). No study sets a single scheme: this is a common progression, adjust it as you like."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les repères publiés couvrent 20 à 79 ans : pour ton âge, seule l’estimation s’affiche.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The published reference values cover ages 20 to 79, so only the estimate is shown for your age."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L’IMC ne distingue pas le muscle de la graisse : c’est un repère de population, pas un diagnostic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BMI doesn't tell muscle from fat: it's a population marker, not a diagnosis."
